          "explanation": "When scheduling stalled, the doctor changed the plan to reassessment for possible core needle biopsy.",
          "quote": "先改门诊粗针穿刺"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00249",
          "explanation": "The doctor addressed the new biopsy concern and kept the priority on obtaining pathology.",
          "quote": "先做穿刺不是耽误"
